<div class="header">
  <div class="headertitle"><div class="title">UnityEngine.XR.ARFoundation.Samples.ARPlaceAnchor Class Reference</div></div>
</div><!--header-->
<div class="contents">

<p>Allows the user to place anchors in the AR space by tapping on the screen. It uses AR Foundation's raycasts to detect surfaces and position the anchors.  
 <a href="#details">More...</a></p>
