<a name="details" id="details"></a><h2 id="header-details" class="groupheader">Detailed Description</h2>
<div class="textblock"><p>Allows the user to place anchors in the AR space by tapping on the screen. It uses AR Foundation's raycasts to detect surfaces and position the anchors. </p>
